{"t_ms": 4472422, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s1_005", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Reception & Concierge Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Front Desk operates 24 hours a day to assist guests with check-in, check-out, travel information, and general inquiries. Concierge services include restaurant reservations, local sightseeing recommendations, transportation arrangements, wake-up calls, and assistance with special guest requests. Staff members are available at all times to provide prompt support and ensure a comfortable stay.", "Printing & Photocopy Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nPrinting, scanning, and photocopying services are available through the Business Centre. Guests may email their documents to the Business Centre or use the available workstations. Standard printing charges apply, while basic scanning services are provided free of charge for registered hotel guests.", "Banquet Dining Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel provides banquet dining services for weddings, conferences, corporate meetings, and private celebrations. Customized buffet and plated meal options are available to suit different event sizes and budgets. Guests planning an event should contact the Banquet Sales Team at least seven days in advance for menu planning and venue arrangements."], "scores": [0.7367318272590637, 0.757015585899353, 0.7839288711547852], "filenames": ["05_reception_services.txt", "46_printing_services.txt", "30_banquet.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 406, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
